<h2 class="doc-h2">Group</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A chord is a group rather than three keys with spaces between them: the group is what says
    they are pressed together.
</p>
<Example Source="KbdGroupExample.razor"><KbdGroupExample /></Example>

